WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:03.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:05.300
[ Jimin's "Like Crazy" playing ]

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.100
[ Music stops ]

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:08.767
-Yeah? Oh, oh, hi.

00:00:08.767 --> 00:00:12.634
Oh, Jimin.
I -- what are you doing here?

00:00:12.634 --> 00:00:15.167
-Can I come in?
-Uh, yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:00:15.167 --> 00:00:17.501
Sure. Yeah, come on in.

00:00:17.501 --> 00:00:19.200
[ Unsettling music plays ]

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.601
♪♪

00:00:24.601 --> 00:00:25.634
Have a seat.
Have a seat.

00:00:25.634 --> 00:00:28.000
Uh, oh, let me clear
this for you.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.667
This is...

00:00:29.667 --> 00:00:31.834
Oh, sorry.

00:00:31.834 --> 00:00:32.934
-You okay?
-Yeah, I'm great.

00:00:32.934 --> 00:00:34.234
I'm happy you're
back on the show.

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:35.767
I mean, you have new music out.

00:00:35.767 --> 00:00:37.234
Of course I didn't know that,
no one knew that.

00:00:37.234 --> 00:00:39.567
I mean, it's out March 24th.
It's called "Face."

00:00:39.567 --> 00:00:40.934
It's pretty awesome.
I heard the single.

00:00:40.934 --> 00:00:42.400
But, you want a drink?
-Sure.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:43.701
-Yeah, a drink would be good.

00:00:43.701 --> 00:00:45.300
I'll get you a -- wow.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:48.000
Uh, that's, uh, your face
is on the can,

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.534
but look, maybe I'll get you
a snack.

00:00:50.534 --> 00:00:53.200
-Dr. Jimin?
-The snack will be good.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.334
[ Air hissing ]

00:00:56.834 --> 00:00:58.167
[ Balloons thudding ]

00:00:58.167 --> 00:00:59.834
You know what? Let me email
my assistant

00:00:59.834 --> 00:01:01.501
and I can get a snack,
we'll get something to eat.

00:01:01.501 --> 00:01:04.133
Maybe we'll --
Whoa, this website's up here.

00:01:04.133 --> 00:01:05.300
That shouldn't be there.

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:08.067
[ Laughs ]
Today is so funny.

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:10.868
Uh, okay, let me get this off.
Uh, let's --

00:01:10.868 --> 00:01:12.901
That's your song. Well, that's
your song, of course.

00:01:12.901 --> 00:01:14.434
You know that.
But that's --

00:01:14.434 --> 00:01:16.334
Louder, it's louder now!
[ Volume rising ]

00:01:16.334 --> 00:01:18.667
You know what? Maybe it's better
if I just see you out there.

00:01:18.667 --> 00:01:20.267
I'll see you out on the floor.
-Good, good idea.

00:01:20.267 --> 00:01:21.434
Thank you. Bye.
-See you.

00:01:21.434 --> 00:01:22.601
-Thank you.
See you.

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:26.601
-[ Sighs ]

00:01:26.601 --> 00:01:29.400
[ Music blaring ]

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:31.801
Jimmy is so cool.

00:01:31.801 --> 00:01:33.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

